1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Hey, how was your day?

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Pretty good! I went to the park and read a book.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:12,000
That sounds relaxing. Did you enjoy the weather?

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,000
Yes,
the sun was shining,
and there was a cool breeze.

5
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:18,000
Nice! I wish I could have joined you.

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,000
Next time, definitely. What about you?

7
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,000
I had a busy morning at work.

8
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,000
Oh, what did you do?

9
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,000
Handled some client meetings and organized files.

10
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:33,000
Sounds productive! Did you take any breaks?

11
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,000
Barely! I grabbed a quick coffee around noon.

12
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:39,000
Coffee always helps. So, any plans for the evening?

13
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,000
Thinking of watching a movie. Maybe order pizza.

14
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:45,000
That's a good idea. Want some company?

15
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:48,000
Sure! The more, the merrier.

16
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:51,000
Great! I'll bring over some snacks too.

17
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:54,000
Awesome. By the way, have you seen my keys?

18
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:57,000
Which keys? The car keys?

19
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:00,000
Yeah, I can't find them anywhere.

20
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:03,000
Did you check the kitchen counter?

21
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:06,000
I looked there but no luck.

22
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:09,000
Maybe in your bag? You were in a rush earlier.

23
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:12,000
Good idea. Let's see...

24
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:15,000
Found them!
They were in your jacket pocket.

25
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:18,000
Oh, of course. Silent pockets strike again.

26
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:21,000
Haha! Happens to everyone. So, what movie are we watching?

27
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:24,000
How about that new sci-fi film?

28
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:27,000
Sounds perfect. I've been wanting to see that.

29
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:30,000
Great! I'll order the pizza now.

30
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:33,000
Do you prefer pepperoni or veggie?

31
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:36,000
Definitely pepperoni. What about drinks?

32
00:01:36,500 --> 00:01:39,000
Soda for me, please. Or maybe some juice.

33
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:42,000
I'll get both! Just to be safe.

34
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:45,000
Perfect. Should we set up the snacks now?

35
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:48,000
Good idea.
I'll grab some chips.

36
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:51,000
And I'll get the dip. Nice and cozy.

37
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:54,000
Yes, just like old times.

38
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:57,000
Remember when we stayed up all night watching films?

39
00:01:57,500 --> 00:02:00,000
How could I forget? That was fun.

40
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:03,000
We should do that again sometime.

41
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:06,000
Absolutely. Maybe next weekend?

42
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:09,000
I'll mark it on my calendar.

43
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:12,000
Looking forward to it already.

44
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:15,000
Me too! Oh, the pizza should arrive soon.

45
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:18,000
Great! Let’s get comfortable till then.

46
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:21,000
Sounds good. See you sitting on the sofa!

47
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:24,000
I'll be there in a minute. Just finishing up here.

48
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:27,000
Alright. Let's enjoy the evening.

49
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:30,000
Can't wait. This will be fun!

50
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:33,000
Definitely. See you soon!